            "sentence_type": "MIDDLE",
            "content_type": "TEXT",
            "text": "🤔好奇 嗯嗯，去湖边散步是个不错的选择呢。"
          },
          {
            "at_ms": 1046.1432660000014,
            "sentence_type": "MIDDLE",
            "content_type": "TEXT",
            "text": "你想准备些什么呢？"
          },
          {
            "at_ms": 1046.1810030000152,
            "sentence_type": "MIDDLE",
            "content_type": "TEXT",
            "text": "\n"
          },
